2. Explain AI, ML, Deep Learning, and GenAI with one diagram

Artificial Intelligence (AI): Technology that performs tasks requiring human-like intelligence.

Machine Learning (ML): A part of AI that learns patterns from data.

Deep Learning (DL): A part of ML that uses multi-layer neural networks.

Generative AI (GenAI): AI that creates new content, such as text, images, audio, or code.

